    <string name="msg_settings_import">Choose a termux-settings-*.zip file exported from this app. Its termux.properties, colors.properties, SSH hosts, app preferences and font replace the current ones, which are copied to ~/.termux/backup first. Saved SSH passwords are not included in exported settings.</string>
